, the reticulated python (Python reticulatus), can grow to a maximum length of about 10.6 meters (35 ft).\n(D) Desert jackals are a medium-salsized canid native to parts of Africa, the Middle East, and the Indian subcontinent. They are the largest of the small to medium-sized canids.", "new_cot_probs": [3.898203999597172e-07, 1.5658150687158923e-07, 2.5316603569081053e-07, 2.1654436466178595e-07], "cot_prob": [-1192.0], "cot_step_prob": [-1240.0]}}}
